(6236782, 922084, 96751, '<td valign="top">Though this is an exceptional motion pan, and the reflections on the road are breathtaking, there isn''t nearly enough orange here.  This might have done much better in the FS.</td>', 'Though this is an exceptional motion pan, and the reflections on the road are breathtaking, there isn''t nearly enough orange here.  This might have done much better in the FS.', '2010-11-29 00:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
