(6236828, 922517, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great smile.  Festooned in fluff.</td>', 'Great smile.  Festooned in fluff.', '2010-11-29 03:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6236834, 922498, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this.', '2010-11-29 03:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6236839, 922408, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is a spectacularly moody image: a lone tree, dramatic sky, warmth of the sunset.  Beautiful photograph.</td>', 'This is a spectacularly moody image: a lone tree, dramatic sky, warmth of the sunset.  Beautiful photograph.', '2010-11-29 03:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6236842, 922571, 103032, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of "orange" tones, maybe just very subtle. However, I love the "solemness" you''ve captured in this image. I like the moodiness in your use of lighting.  The shadows convey that solemn feel you''re going for.  I''m trying to do images like this also; one thought that came to mind was to get her eye that is exposed in sharp focus in lieu of the hat band, where it seems to have the most focus.  I also like the tight crop/framing and that she is looking off and seemingly far away. Really like this pic.</td>', 'Not a lot of "orange" tones, maybe just very subtle. However, I love the "solemness" you''ve captured in this image. I like the moodiness in your use of lighting.  The shadows convey that solemn feel you''re going for.  I''m trying to do images like this also; one thought that came to mind was to get her eye that is exposed in sharp focus in lieu of the hat band, where it seems to have the most focus.  I also like the tight crop/framing and that she is looking off and seemingly far away. Really like this pic.', '2010-11-29 03:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6236844, 922592, 60173, '<td valign="top">The top of the iris blends fairly well, but the bottom bit is noticeably choppy. Don''t forget to feather selections.<br/> <br/>That being said, I don''t buy an orange eye even if it is a really pretty shade and nicely in focus.</td>', 'The top of the iris blends fairly well, but the bottom bit is noticeably choppy. Don''t forget to feather selections. That being said, I don''t buy an orange eye even if it is a really pretty shade and nicely in focus.', '2010-11-29 03:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6236848, 921999, 49788, '<td valign="top">Very nicely executed. Impressive cutting! 8</td>', 'Very nicely executed. Impressive cutting! 8', '2010-11-29 03:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6236851, 922437, 51638, '<td valign="top">Could you have found a POV/crop that eliminated the soccer goals? If so I think the image would have been stronger without them being a distraction.</td>', 'Could you have found a POV/crop that eliminated the soccer goals? If so I think the image would have been stronger without them being a distraction.', '2010-11-29 03:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6236852, 922560, 51638, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, with excellent DOF and tack sharp focus on the droplets.</td>', 'Nicely done, with excellent DOF and tack sharp focus on the droplets.', '2010-11-29 03:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6236853, 922423, 51638, '<td valign="top">Nice bird shot with very pleasant bokeh.</td>', 'Nice bird shot with very pleasant bokeh.', '2010-11-29 03:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6236854, 922358, 51638, '<td valign="top">Bit of stretch to suggest that the dominant subject is ''orange''. Any why not straighten it?</td>', 'Bit of stretch to suggest that the dominant subject is ''orange''. Any why not straighten it?', '2010-11-29 03:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6236856, 922523, 51638, '<td valign="top">Focus needs to be sharper on at least some part of the petal and the central placement and extensive negative space doesn''t make for a particularly interesting image IMO.</td>', 'Focus needs to be sharper on at least some part of the petal and the central placement and extensive negative space doesn''t make for a particularly interesting image IMO.', '2010-11-29 03:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6236857, 922396, 51638, '<td valign="top">Could you have shot this with a black background? I would have made the orange ''pop'' more. As it is, with the shallow DOF making much of the image OOF and white background it looks a little washed out.</td>', 'Could you have shot this with a black background? I would have made the orange ''pop'' more. As it is, with the shallow DOF making much of the image OOF and white background it looks a little washed out.', '2010-11-29 04:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
