(6236860, 922594, 51638, '<td valign="top">Focus is soft, lighting is harsh and subject matter is somewhat confusing. Maybe I''m missing something.</td>', 'Focus is soft, lighting is harsh and subject matter is somewhat confusing. Maybe I''m missing something.', '2010-11-29 04:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
