(6237394, 922032, 96751, '<td valign="top">Although the quality of this image is a little weak, I am impressed with the concept and execution - especially the changing of the shirts - and look forward to reading about your set-up.</td>', 'Although the quality of this image is a little weak, I am impressed with the concept and execution - especially the changing of the shirts - and look forward to reading about your set-up.', '2010-11-29 12:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237395, 922270, 120171, '<td valign="top">My first impressions of this are that it is a little soft and tad dull, but having viewed the original image "Tangerine Dream" it maybe that this is the opposite and it is not dull enough.<br/> <br/>I personally feel that this image would have had greater impact if it was well lit and sharp or the complete opposite and more in keeping with the original.<br/> <br/>Having said all that the layout is good replication and the border works well.</td>', 'My first impressions of this are that it is a little soft and tad dull, but having viewed the original image "Tangerine Dream" it maybe that this is the opposite and it is not dull enough. I personally feel that this image would have had greater impact if it was well lit and sharp or the complete opposite and more in keeping with the original. Having said all that the layout is good replication and the border works well.', '2010-11-29 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237428, 922069, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  That one curled petal seems  made to order for a beauty shot.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  That one curled petal seems  made to order for a beauty shot.', '2010-11-29 13:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237430, 922572, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous!!!  Inspired and artistic.  The lighting is just divine, as is the use of negative space.  Certainly a stand-out in this challenge.</td>', 'Marvelous!!!  Inspired and artistic.  The lighting is just divine, as is the use of negative space.  Certainly a stand-out in this challenge.', '2010-11-29 13:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237432, 922271, 96751, '<td valign="top">Flamingos are SO photogenic, but I feel like a bit of detail in the feathers was lost due to oversaturation.</td>', 'Flamingos are SO photogenic, but I feel like a bit of detail in the feathers was lost due to oversaturation.', '2010-11-29 13:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237433, 922575, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower macro.</td>', 'Beautiful flower macro.', '2010-11-29 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237434, 922520, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Love the tiny bubbles all over him.  I think this might have had even more impact if you''d rotated the image, just to give it a slightly different pov.</td>', 'Very nice!  Love the tiny bubbles all over him.  I think this might have had even more impact if you''d rotated the image, just to give it a slightly different pov.', '2010-11-29 13:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237436, 922394, 96751, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture.  I like the idea of using the ornament as a vase, and of course, the dropping petal is terrific.  But for me, the overall yellow cast dampens the energy of this image.  Undecided about the hard line between the yellow and orange at the back. You have a really nice gradient going at the top of the bg, and that would have been nice to continue throughout.</td>', 'Terrific capture.  I like the idea of using the ornament as a vase, and of course, the dropping petal is terrific.  But for me, the overall yellow cast dampens the energy of this image.  Undecided about the hard line between the yellow and orange at the back. You have a really nice gradient going at the top of the bg, and that would have been nice to continue throughout.', '2010-11-29 13:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237440, 922204, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images that''s so easy to flip by without a second look, and yet something made me stop.  I don''t find it particularly pretty, but there is something rather compelling about it.  Maybe it''s all the vertical lines, or the electric orange color. Or because the fence looks like a train, and each section is a boxcar. Or maybe the bits of people peeking out.  But we wonder why this is blocked off, and follow the orange train down the tracks.</td>', 'This is one of those images that''s so easy to flip by without a second look, and yet something made me stop.  I don''t find it particularly pretty, but there is something rather compelling about it.  Maybe it''s all the vertical lines, or the electric orange color. Or because the fence looks like a train, and each section is a boxcar. Or maybe the bits of people peeking out.  But we wonder why this is blocked off, and follow the orange train down the tracks.', '2010-11-29 13:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237441, 922348, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image.  The b/w is splendid, as is the detail of the water.  I wish this had been entered elsewhere as the desat feels forced to fit this noble image into a challenge where it doesn''t belong.</td>', 'Gorgeous image.  The b/w is splendid, as is the detail of the water.  I wish this had been entered elsewhere as the desat feels forced to fit this noble image into a challenge where it doesn''t belong.', '2010-11-29 13:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237442, 922442, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.</td>', 'Great action shot.', '2010-11-29 13:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
