(6237444, 921893, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the gradient in the sky, and the cut-out silhouettes.  Composition is a bit too centered for me.</td>', 'Love the gradient in the sky, and the cut-out silhouettes.  Composition is a bit too centered for me.', '2010-11-29 13:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237445, 922595, 96751, '<td valign="top">Bold and beautiful.</td>', 'Bold and beautiful.', '2010-11-29 13:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237450, 922414, 96751, '<td valign="top">This just might be my pick for the blue.  Spectacular in every sense of the world.  Awesome lines, and the detail on those trees is breathtaking.  And even though the orange skiff is the subject and perfectly anchors the shot, there is much to enjoy everywhere.  Thought the day may appear sad and dull and gray, the little boat offers us a Mona Lisa smile.</td>', 'This just might be my pick for the blue.  Spectacular in every sense of the world.  Awesome lines, and the detail on those trees is breathtaking.  And even though the orange skiff is the subject and perfectly anchors the shot, there is much to enjoy everywhere.  Thought the day may appear sad and dull and gray, the little boat offers us a Mona Lisa smile.', '2010-11-29 13:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237452, 922058, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Yes, indeed. To be seen or not.</td>', 'LOL!  Yes, indeed. To be seen or not.', '2010-11-29 13:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237453, 922586, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I think I can actually hear them!  Too funny.  Nicely lit.</td>', 'LOL!  I think I can actually hear them!  Too funny.  Nicely lit.', '2010-11-29 13:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237454, 922244, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice use of topaz.  I really like these kind of images where a repetitive pattern is broken up unexpectedly.</td>', 'Nice use of topaz.  I really like these kind of images where a repetitive pattern is broken up unexpectedly.', '2010-11-29 13:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237457, 922541, 96751, '<td valign="top">The crispness of this image makes me feel like it''s a chilly early Spring or late Fall day.  I want to inhale deeply.</td>', 'The crispness of this image makes me feel like it''s a chilly early Spring or late Fall day.  I want to inhale deeply.', '2010-11-29 13:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237458, 922504, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great lines!</td>', 'Great lines!', '2010-11-29 13:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237460, 922295, 96751, '<td valign="top">Strange and compelling.  I''m guessing this was taken from behind a glass, which had the light beams on it?  They could easily have spoiled the image, but instead, become an enigmatic and powerful element in it.  Are aliens targeting a landing spot?  Has Hollywood out-Hollywooded itself in lighting effects?  Love this.</td>', 'Strange and compelling.  I''m guessing this was taken from behind a glass, which had the light beams on it?  They could easily have spoiled the image, but instead, become an enigmatic and powerful element in it.  Are aliens targeting a landing spot?  Has Hollywood out-Hollywooded itself in lighting effects?  Love this.', '2010-11-29 13:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237462, 922486, 96751, '<td valign="top">You caught it just as it was curling up for bed.  Or getting up in the morning...<br/> <br/>Beautiful shapes and colors, and the lighting is superb.  An excellent use of negative space.</td>', 'You caught it just as it was curling up for bed.  Or getting up in the morning... Beautiful shapes and colors, and the lighting is superb.  An excellent use of negative space.', '2010-11-29 13:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
