(6242631, 922500, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like what you were going for here. I have a few suggestions I think that could have made this better:<br/>* Her smile only looks half-hearted. It says "what am I doing here" instead of "This is a lot of fun"<br/>* The flash just doesn''t feel right. I think it''s the cool color against the warm color of the setting sun. A gel to color the flash may be able to help.</td>', 'I like what you were going for here. I have a few suggestions I think that could have made this better:* Her smile only looks half-hearted. It says "what am I doing here" instead of "This is a lot of fun"* The flash just doesn''t feel right. I think it''s the cool color against the warm color of the setting sun. A gel to color the flash may be able to help.', '2010-12-02 20:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
