(6245499, 922545, 53814, '<td valign="top">Colors and effect are perfect. I had to look at this on my calibrated monitor to fully appreciate the technique. It is a combination of watercolor, pen/ink, charcoal, plus a few techniques I''ve never seen before. <br/>If I thought you were actually driving (with your knees) while taking this photo it would be my favorite of this challenge. As it is, this is in a three-way tie for my favorite. Well done!</td>', 'Colors and effect are perfect. I had to look at this on my calibrated monitor to fully appreciate the technique. It is a combination of watercolor, pen/ink, charcoal, plus a few techniques I''ve never seen before. If I thought you were actually driving (with your knees) while taking this photo it would be my favorite of this challenge. As it is, this is in a three-way tie for my favorite. Well done!', '2010-12-05 22:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
