(6246547, 922258, 90098, '<td valign="top">I am taking a photo class right now just to knock out my art credit for my gen eds.  We had to watch this stupid old out-dated kodak movie with this guy who put you to sleep.  He talk about mergers and said, "Look at how silly I look with this coat rack behind me, it looks like its coming out of my head!"  so lame, haha.  But this reminds me of that with the clouds behind you and your wife.</td>', 'I am taking a photo class right now just to knock out my art credit for my gen eds.  We had to watch this stupid old out-dated kodak movie with this guy who put you to sleep.  He talk about mergers and said, "Look at how silly I look with this coat rack behind me, it looks like its coming out of my head!"  so lame, haha.  But this reminds me of that with the clouds behind you and your wife.', '2010-12-06 19:17:56.000000', NULL, 0),
