(6249213, 922575, 30861, '<td valign="top">You know what''s funny about this, I can''t ever recall actually seeing a rose I thought really qualified as "orange", but here one is. I''m assuming from your notes the color is "real"... Not the most imaginative shot, but very well-executed and truly soothing to contemplate. Congrats on ribbon!</td>', 'You know what''s funny about this, I can''t ever recall actually seeing a rose I thought really qualified as "orange", but here one is. I''m assuming from your notes the color is "real"... Not the most imaginative shot, but very well-executed and truly soothing to contemplate. Congrats on ribbon!', '2010-12-08 16:08:16.000000', NULL, 0),
